cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and keep each recipe's own credit line and links
  (ATTRIBUTION.md).
type: dataset
title: Open recipe corpus
abstract: >-
  Recipes from the Wikibooks and Wikisource cookbooks, structured into fields (servings, times, metric amounts,
  numbered steps, allergens, diet tags, Wikidata dish links) and checked, released per language with every
  translation checked on its own. Served free as data, a REST API and an MCP server. AI dish and step illustrations
  are included under CC0 and labelled as AI-generated.
authors:
  - name: Airon
    website: https://airon.app
  - name: Wikibooks and Wikisource contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/Rippy1911/open-recipe-corpus
url: https://cookbook.airon.app
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-07
keywords:
  - recipes
  - cookbook
  - multilingual
  - open data
  - dataset
  - translation
  - Wikibooks
  - Wikisource
  - Wikidata
  - Polish cuisine
  - MCP
